        "cmd": "grep -vE '^\\[[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}\\] ALERT [^ ]+ not running$' /home/user/monitoring/alerts.log",
